# Array Information

```text
a.ndim                 → number of dimensions
a.shape                → size of each dimension
a.size                 → total number of elements
a.dtype                → data type of elements
a.itemsize             → bytes used by each element
a.nbytes               → total bytes used by the array
a.T                    → transpose of the array
a.strides               → bytes to step in each dimension
a.flags                → memory/layout information
```

