# Arithmetic

```text
np.add()                → adds two arrays element-by-element
np.subtract()           → subtracts arrays element-by-element
np.multiply()           → multiplies arrays element-by-element
np.divide()             → divides arrays element-by-element
np.true_divide()        → performs true division
np.floor_divide()       → performs floor division
np.power()              → raises elements to a power
np.square()             → squares every element
np.reciprocal()         → calculates 1/x for every element
np.mod()                → calculates remainder
np.remainder()          → calculates remainder
np.fmod()               → calculates remainder using C-style behavior
```

You can also simply use:

```text
a + b                   → element-wise addition
a - b                   → element-wise subtraction
a * b                   → element-wise multiplication
a / b                   → element-wise division
a // b                  → element-wise floor division
a % b                   → element-wise remainder
a ** b                  → element-wise power
```

